{"code":0,"data":{"title":"统一退款回调通知","content":"<h1 id=\"s-qc4775r9\">一、接口说明</h1><ul><li><p>退款订单到终态后vivo支付平台通过接口回调给开发者，回调接口地址为下单时传入，开发者可通过回调或者回查进行订单终态的闭环。</p></li><li><p>vivo支付平台回调方式默认为<code>POST</code>，开发者如需更改回调请求方式为<code>GET</code>，可根据自身规范要求联系vivo支付平台说明情况并要求更改，支付成功回调需与退款回调方式保持一致，即支付为<code>GET</code>，退款也为<code>GET</code>。</p></li></ul><h1 id=\"s-1icd3num\"><br>二、接口请求</h1><h2 id=\"s-bit6bchp\">2.1 回调请求参数</h2><h3 id=\"s-6ywvnf66\">Headers：</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"337\" style=\"width: 337px\"><p><strong>参数值</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"90\" style=\"width: 90px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Content-Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"337\" style=\"width: 337px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"90\" style=\"width: 90px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-vktc0jr0\">Body：</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>S</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>固定为S字符串</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>固定空字符串</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>6947683482730496</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单appId</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20241126257135033151488</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo交易订单</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>AS202401240000000028330601</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商户订单号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>14660296298935091201</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo退款订单号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantRefundNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>RE2024012400000000283306</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商户退款订单号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundStatus</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refund_failure</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>退款状态。<br>refund_success 退款完成<br>refund_failure 退款失败<br>回调结果只有退款完成和退款失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>50000</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易订单金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>50000</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>退款金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payRefundAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>50000</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【历史废弃字段】历史退款金额字段，单位分，同refundAmount，新接入业务忽略该字段</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>discountRefundAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【历史废弃字段】忽略该字段的值，该字段仅会为0</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>currencyType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>CNY</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>货币类型，默认固定为CNY</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundDesc</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>用户账户异常或已注销，不能原路退回，请使用其他方式进行退款。</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>退款订单，退款失败描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundTime</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20241118102231</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单终态完成时间</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundChannelDetail</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>[{\"paymentWayCode\":\"WECHAT_APP\",<br>\"refundAmount\":50000,\"bankCode\":\"\",\"bankName\":\"\"}]</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>退款详情，JSON数组字符串，对象格式详见refundChannelDetail 中对象格式</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>QWFGQFWQ55GWEG</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名，签名需验签，验签操作见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>signType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"64\" style=\"width: 64px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"400\" style=\"width: 400px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>RSA</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"453\" style=\"width: 453px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名类型，固定为RSA</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-jfeaedvj\">refundChannelDetail 中对象格式</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\"><p><strong>字段</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式标识，见 paymentWayCode 支付方式映射编码</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>refundAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>退款金额，单位为分</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bankCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>银行卡code标识，当使用钱包中银行卡支付方式时返回，不是微信支付宝中的银行卡</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bankName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>银行名称，当使用钱包中银行卡支付方式时返回</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"185\" style=\"width: 185px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bankCardSuffix</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"97\" style=\"width: 97px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"575\" style=\"width: 575px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>银行卡号四位，当使用钱包中银行卡支付方式时返回</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"77\" style=\"width: 77px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-8fhydfyy\">paymentWayCode 支付方式映射编码</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>代号</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\"><p><strong>名称</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ALIPAY_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付宝</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_INDIRECT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信间联支付</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-og4eutc5\">2.2 请求响应</h2><ul><li><p>业务方在接收到回调，业务处理完成后可响应支付平台 <code>success</code> 或者 <code>SUCCESS</code> ，两种success字符串标识均代表成功，其他响应支付平台均认定为回调失败</p></li><li><p>在回调失败后vivo支付平台会进行梯度间隔时间重试，累计回调请求15次，默认重试间隔如下：<code>2s:3s:5s:10s:1m:5m:20m:1h:2h:3h:3h:3h:6h:6h</code></p></li></ul><h1 id=\"s-c585zuef\"><br>三、请求响应示例</h1><h2 id=\"s-x817p0qi\">3.1 退款回调请求示例</h2><pre><code>{\n    \"code\": \"S\",\n    \"msg\": \"\",\n    \"appId\": \"6947683482730496\",\n    \"tradeOrderNo\": \"1682012828082530304\",\n    \"merchantOrderNo\": \"783518501962008256\",\n    \"refundNo\": \"1682517717887772672\",\n    \"merchantRefundNo\": \"783770868125026880\",\n    \"refundStatus\": \"refund_success\",\n    \"tradeAmount\": \"1\",\n    \"refundAmount\": \"1\",\n    \"payRefundAmount\": \"1\",\n    \"discountRefundAmount\": \"0\",\n    \"currencyType\": \"CNY\",\n    \"refundDesc\": \"\",\n    \"refundTime\": \"20241118102231\",\n    \"refundChannelDetail\": \"[{\\\"bankCode\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"paymentWayCode\\\":\\\"WECHAT_APP\\\",\\\"bankName\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"refundAmount\\\":\\\"1\\\"}]\",\n    \"sign\": \"\",\n    \"signType\": \"RSA\"\n}\n</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-e0kmpvop\">3.2 获取待验签字符串</h2><p>详细验签流程见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p><p>vivo支付获取加签/验签内容全局统一，具体方法为整体参数在剔除<code>sign</code>、<code>signType</code>两个字段后，将剩余字段按照字典序排序并用<code>&amp;</code>符号将各个参数按<code>key=value</code>格式拼接得到待加签/验签字符串内容。上述回调请求示例中待验签字符串内容如下：</p><pre><code>appId=6947683482730496&amp;code=S&amp;currencyType=CNY&amp;discountRefundAmount=0&amp;merchantOrderNo=783518501962008256&amp;merchantRefundNo=783770868125026880&amp;payRefundAmount=1&amp;refundAmount=1&amp;refundChannelDetail=[{\"bankCode\":\"\",\"paymentWayCode\":\"WECHAT_APP\",\"bankName\":\"\",\"refundAmount\":\"1\"}]&amp;refundNo=1682517717887772672&amp;refundStatus=refund_success&amp;refundTime=20241118102231&amp;&amp;signType=RSA&amp;tradeAmount=1&amp;tradeOrderNo=1682012828082530304</code></pre><p></p>","versionCode":3,"updateTime":1734086698000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用支付平台接入,收银台模式,统一退款回调通知","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}